<title>FINLAND: SAUNATEC JAN-AUG PROFIT UP 51 PCT.</title>
<headline>SAUNATEC JAN-AUG PROFIT UP 51 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   5.6 vs 3.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)(after tax)    1.52 vs 1.20</p>
<p> Net sales					   98.6 vs 90.9</p>
<p> Operating profit				   6.7 vs 6.1</p>
<p> Depreciation					 3.8 vs 3.5</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 1.1 vs 2.4 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  5.6 vs 3.7</p>
<p> Taxes						  1.9 vs 0.8</p>
<p> Net profit					   3.7 vs 2.9</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    52.7 vs 47.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish sauna equipment maker is Oy</p>
<p>Saunatec Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
</text>
